  "helpStressTest": "Walton's stress test audits the fidelity of reasoning. It reveals 'Post-Hoc rationalization' if the AI has merely invented justifications afterwards and did not actually derive the result from them.",
  "helpCausal": "Causal analysis compares the actual event to a simulated alternative scenario (counterfactual) to understand cause-and-effect relationships.",
  "helpProfiler": "Profiling analyzes text tone, vocabulary, and latent biases. It helps identify if the AI is attempting to manipulate or is biased.",
  "helpFactCheck": "Fact-checking compares claims to known sources and checks for ethical risks (e.g. hate speech, discrimination).",
  "helpPerformativity": "Performativity check evaluates whether the AI is 'acting' a role or acting genuinely. It looks for signs of feigned empathy or excessive sycophancy.",
  "helpArchivist": "The Archivist checks whether the response complies with organization rules (Compliance) and aligns with previous precedents.",
